# Octave buttons and notes far outside the 24 keys: -2 / -1 / +1 / +2 octaves (+-24 per press) and MIDI 0 and 127.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.5
track sample
param p1 128 0
param p2 128 0
note 0 5 1 120
note 2 29 1 120
note 4 77 1 120
note 6 101 1 120
note 8 24 1 120
note 10 48 1 120
note 12 96 1 120
note 14 120 1 120
note 16 0 1 120
note 18 127 1 120
note 20 18 1 120
note 22 114 1 120
track kick
param p1 0 0
param p2 0 0
note 24 5 1 127
note 26 101 1 127
param p1 255 27
note 28 21 1 127
note 30 117 1 127
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 48
expect peak_below -6
